        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I had the pleasure of receiving waxing, threading, and tint services on June 19th 2025. Dipika was smiling, funny, polite, gentle, thorough, thoughtful and generous.\n\nShe makes sure to respond to you when possible.\n\nI plan on rescheduling just before New Year’s Eve if possible, and if not, in 2026 for sure!\n\nIf you are wondering why I have not rescheduled sooner, it is simply because of life being busy and using a home electric epilator when necessary.\nThe experience with Dipika was a good one and I don’t foresee going anywhere else!",
        "time": 1767057890,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Davinder Kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108472989168392030795/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0QvhVRTJaIs0Cktuf71ALF-ZB345JxI3j-VBrfDcFZKZim5Ve=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Dipika has a great eye for detail, she WANTS you to leave hairless!! I travel from Toronto every couple months for my appointments. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1766514818,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karolyn Alarie",
